{'symbol': 'APTV', 'date': '2021-11-17 16:30:00', 'title': 'APTIV DECLARES QUARTERLY PREFERRED SHARE DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DUBLIN, NOV. 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- APTIV PLC (NYSE: APTV),\xa0A GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY COMPANY FOCUSED ON MAKING MOBILITY SAFER, GREENER AND MORE CONNECTED, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.375 PER SHARE ON ITS 5.50% SERIES A MANDATORY CONVERTIBLE PREFERRED SHARES, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 15, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 1, 2021. ABOUT APTIV APTIV IS A GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT DEVELOPS SAFER, GREENER AND MORE CONNECTED SOLUTIONS ENABLING A MORE SUSTAINABLE FUTURE OF MOBILITY.'}